<title>NETHERLANDS: Ahold unit to buy Klerks stores.</title>
<headline>Ahold unit to buy Klerks stores.</headline>
<dateline>ZAANDAM, Netherlands 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch supermarkets group Ahold NV said on Tuesday its Dutch liquor and wine store subsidiary Gall &amp; Gall had signed a letter of intent to buy all outstanding shares of Klerks Liquor stores in the Netherlands.  </p>
<p>Klerks' 14 off-licences located in the west of the Netherlands have annual sales of around 38 million guilders, Ahold said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Upon completion, the acquisition will further strengthen Gall&amp;Gall's already leading position in the Dutch liquor market,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>No financials details were given.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
